I moved to another ICH9 system that has support for PMP in the BIOS.
Before and after the patch, I am able to use the PMP, but I still get
errors.  I have attached the dmesg output w/ patch to this email.  In
this case, I booted the system with the PMP turned off and then switched
it on after the system was up and running, so you will see the PMP
messages at the bottom.

On the old system, I get the error messages, but still never see the
drives in /sys/block/

Thanks,

Jason


